WEBVTT

00:01:58.236 --> 00:02:00.396
we love to talk about them,

00:02:00.396 --> 00:02:02.556
but we feel we should
be able to control them.

00:02:03.516 --> 00:02:05.636
Here’s Lara and Pavel.

00:02:06.076 --> 00:02:08.236
They’re from different
countries and cultures,

00:02:08.236 --> 00:02:11.356
and they’re making their life
together in London.

00:02:11.836 --> 00:02:14.796
They’re arguing about what
digital technologies

00:02:14.836 --> 00:02:17.436
their six-year-old son,
Thomas, should use.

00:02:17.796 --> 00:02:20.956
Lara, originally from Brazil, is excited.

00:02:22.556 --> 00:02:24.396
Pavel, from Poland,

00:02:24.436 --> 00:02:25.556
he’s worried.

00:02:26.636 --> 00:02:28.716
But more fundamentally,

00:02:28.756 --> 00:02:33.036
they’re arguing about
how their lives should be in London